    "title": "Игровые гайды и прохождения",
    "sub": "How to beat the boss: инструкции",
    "theory": "<h3>Язык гайдов</h3><p>Гайды — это инструкции. Узнавайте конструкции:</p>\n<ul><li><b>Imperative</b>: Head north. Grab the key. Equip your shield.</li><li><b>Sequencing</b>: First, ... Then, ... Once you've..., ... After that, ... Finally, ...</li><li><b>Условия</b>: If you're playing solo, ... Make sure you have... Unless you have fire resistance, avoid...</li><li><b>Совет</b>: I'd recommend... It's worth... You'll want to... Don't bother with...</li></ul>\n<div class=\"ex\"><b>Once you've unlocked the second area, head to the blacksmith.</b><i>Как только откроете вторую зону, идите к кузнецу.</i></div><div class=\"ex\"><b>It's worth upgrading your armor before the boss.</b><i>Стоит улучшить броню перед боссом.</i></div>\n<h3>Игровая лексика</h3><p>boss fight, phase, cooldown, loot, drop, grind, spawn, checkpoint, build, nerf/buff, patch.</p>\n<div class=\"tip\">«It's worth + -ing» и «Don't bother + -ing» — частые конструкции. «You'll want to» = советую (не «вы захотите»).</div>",
